{
  "id": "agentMemorySharedNamespace",
  "name": "Shared memory across agents without bleed (Redis Agent Memory)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Two agents, one customer, no bleed\n\nMulti-channel and multi-agent builds (a sales bot and a support bot on the same customer) are among the most-discussed memory problems in the n8n forum: either each agent forgets what the other learned, or one customer's facts leak into another's chat.\n\nHere both agents write to and recall from one **shared namespace** (`customer-facts`), while the **User ID** keeps customers apart inside it. Each agent keeps its own session, so conversation history does not mix.\n\nTry it:\n1. Select your **Redis Agent Memory API** and **OpenAI** credentials.\n2. Click **Set up once** and run it. It creates the namespace.\n3. Open the chat. Say: *sales: We are a team of 12 and our budget is 500 a month.*\n4. Start a new chat and say: *support: Which plan fits us?* The support agent knows the team size and budget it was never told.\n5. Change `userId` in **Identify the customer** to `other-customer` and ask again: nothing is known.\n\nThe namespace is looked up by name on each turn so the example runs without pasting IDs; in production store the namespace ID once (a Set node, a workflow variable) and skip the lookup.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "setup-trigger",
      "name": "Set up once",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "namespace",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "customer-facts",
        "scope": "SHARED",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "create-namespace",
      "name": "Create the shared namespace",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "chat-trigger",
      "name": "When chat message received",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "7c2f0d4b-3a7e-4f9c-b2d8-0e1f3a4b5c02"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "namespace",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "id": "find-namespaces",
      "name": "Find namespaces",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "by-name",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "rightValue": "customer-facts",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pick-namespace",
      "name": "Pick customer-facts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "user-id",
              "name": "userId",
              "value": "demo-customer",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "namespace-id",
              "name": "namespaceId",
              "value": "={{ $json.namespaceId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "session-id",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "value": "={{ $('When chat message received').item.json.sessionId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "chat-input",
              "name": "chatInput",
              "value": "={{ $('When chat message received').item.json.chatInput }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "identify-customer",
      "name": "Identify the customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-sales",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.chatInput.trim().toLowerCase() }}",
                    "rightValue": "sales:",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "sales"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "support"
        }
      },
      "id": "which-team",
      "name": "Which team?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput.replace(/^sales:\\s*/i, '') }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the sales assistant. Facts the customer shares (team size, budget, timeline, requirements) matter to every team: save each one with the Save shared memory tool. Before recommending anything, check the Search shared memories tool for what the customer has already told any team."
        }
      },
      "id": "sales-agent",
      "name": "Sales agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput.replace(/^support:\\s*/i, '') }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the support assistant. Before asking the customer for details, check the Search shared memories tool: sales may already know their team size, budget and plan. Save new lasting facts with the Save shared memory tool so other teams see them."
        }
      },
      "id": "support-agent",
      "name": "Support agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionId": "=sales-{{ $json.sessionId }}",
        "ownerId": "={{ $json.userId }}",
        "recallLongTermMemories": true,
        "options": {
          "namespaceId": "={{ $json.namespaceId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "sales-memory",
      "name": "Sales memory (shared namespace)",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentChatMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionId": "=support-{{ $json.sessionId }}",
        "ownerId": "={{ $json.userId }}",
        "recallLongTermMemories": true,
        "options": {
          "namespaceId": "={{ $json.namespaceId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "support-memory",
      "name": "Support memory (shared namespace)",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentChatMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Search what this customer has told any team (sales or support) in earlier conversations: team size, budget, plan, requirements, open issues.",
        "resource": "longTermMemory",
        "operation": "search",
        "query": "={{ $fromAI('query', 'What to look for in the customer\\'s shared memories', 'string') }}",
        "ownerId": "={{ $('Identify the customer').item.json.userId }}",
        "limit": 5,
        "options": {
          "namespaceId": "={{ $('Identify the customer').item.json.namespaceId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "search-shared",
      "name": "Search shared memories",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemoryTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Remember a lasting fact about this customer so every team sees it: one sentence, such as team size, budget, plan or a requirement.",
        "resource": "longTermMemory",
        "operation": "create",
        "text": "={{ $fromAI('text', 'The fact to remember, in one sentence', 'string') }}",
        "ownerId": "={{ $('Identify the customer').item.json.userId }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "namespaceId": "={{ $('Identify the customer').item.json.namespaceId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "save-shared",
      "name": "Save shared memory",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemoryTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        20
      ]
    }
  ],
